>you've just put on a cursed pair of levitation boots. you remember someone
>saying there must be 15 ways to leave your loafers. can you name at least
>15 ways? committing suicide and hoping for bones doesn't count ... and
>there's no need to post your answers here. you can send me mail to compare
>lists.

1) Pray.  You don't have to be at an altar; I specifically added a check for
this.
2-4) Remove curse--scroll, spell, or magic trap.
5) Dip them in holy water.
6) Let a nymph take them.
7) Let a succubus/incubus (depending on your sex) take them.
8) Read a scroll of destroy armor.
9) Read a scroll of enchant armor.
10-14) Polymorph into something which does not wear boots.  (Wand of polymorph,
spell of polymorph, ring of polymorph, polymorph trap, sink)
15-16) Drop everything else and use cancellation on yourself (Wand of
cancellation, spell of cancellation)
